REQ-PRODUCTION-007,IMPLEMENTED,635,636,,"PR #636 implements the canonical M4 ProductionUnit lifecycle/startup boundary: one live status authority initialized from immutable seed status; PLANNED startup INVESTMENT intents from opening unit cash; explicit zero-sum owner funding in the Region settlement currency; deterministic cadence-bound Phase-14 reviews for ACTIVE mothballing, MOTHBALLED reactivation/closing and CLOSING retirement; exact next-tick lifecycle activation through pending transitions; fail-closed evidence re-derivation and safe retirement; and live-status gating in Phase-2 planning, Phase-5 execution and Phase-12 capital formation. Focused regressions in src/simulation/productionUnitLifecycle.test.ts and src/simulation/productionStartupPlanning.test.ts cover startup readiness/N+1 activation, same-tick causal isolation, funding conservation, configured consecutive reviews/reset/reactivation/closing, residual-stock retirement refusal/safe retirement, seed/live-status divergence, insertion-order determinism and tampered lifecycle evidence. Merge commit intentionally blank until integration."
